{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fawn the Florist is a <strong>cozy, idle game</strong> that sits at the bottom of your screen acting as your peaceful garden space you can tend to while you work, study or relax. Players are tasked with helping our dear friend, Fawn, to uncover wondrous new flowers whilst creating their own flourishing garden with the assistance of some friendly critters to create the garden of their dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854120/extras/4376f61a7022281d5025b2d9260f4abd.poster.avif?t=1763701243\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854120/extras/4376f61a7022281d5025b2d9260f4abd.webm?t=1763701243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock New Flowers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the scorching fire of the Volcanic Zinnias to the calming droplets of the Hydrogenas, discover all the beautiful flowers along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854120/extras/5dfd6ab605742f3aea08fa37dc3db6bd.avif?t=1763701243\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854120/extras_big/5dfd6ab605742f3aea08fa37dc3db6bd.webp?t=1763701243 width=1560 height=321 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enlist the Help of your Critter Companions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By building homes and providing care, you can befriend a cast of critter companions. In return for your love, they'll help you maintain your garden while you're busy or relaxing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854120/extras/910950dfc1900e9d5c5dad8145b21bb5.avif?t=1763701243\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854120/extras_big/910950dfc1900e9d5c5dad8145b21bb5.webp?t=1763701243 width=1560 height=321 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Complete Quests for Fawn</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on simple tasks for Fawn and breathe new life into her gardens!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854120/extras/f335732dbe3e0db84b9c46b476646d3b.avif?t=1763701243\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854120/extras_big/f335732dbe3e0db84b9c46b476646d3b.webp?t=1763701243 width=1560 height=321 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Position the Game to your Needs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust the resolution position of your game to fit your purpose and needs to comfortably grow your garden from your desktop!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854120/extras/a3f672287db343d7bb08532982ce683c.poster.avif?t=1763701243\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854120/extras/a3f672287db343d7bb08532982ce683c.webm?t=1763701243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Bloom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854120/4e7951f927782d849a544ddabf02bab611f088c4.jpg"},{"name":"Calming Scent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854120/9ba2e65d5b