ing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854120/extras/910950dfc1900e9d5c5dad8145b21bb5.avif?t=1763701243\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854120/extras_big/910950dfc1900e9d5c5dad8145b21bb5.webp?t=1763701243 width=1560 height=321 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Complete Quests for Fawn</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on simple tasks for Fawn and breathe new life into her gardens!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854120/extras/f335732dbe3e0db84b9c46b476646d3b.avif?t=1763701243\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854120/extras_big/f335732dbe3e0db84b9c46b476646d3b.webp?t=1763701243 width=1560 height=321 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Position the Game to your Needs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust the resolution position of your game to fit your purpose and needs to comfortably grow your garden from your desktop!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854120/extras/a3f672287db343d7bb08532982ce683c.poster.avif?t=1763701243\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854120/extras/a3f672287db343d7bb08532982ce683c.webm?t=1763701243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["CozyBit Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https